#
# Owner, after D-0236 shrank the agent column from ten panels to five: still too much,
# and an "abyss" of blank space between the bench (short) and the agent column (still
# tall) — five always-expanded panels made the column's height the SUM of all five.
#
# The agent column becomes a menu: five buttons (Conversation/Plan/Agent activity/
# Authority requests/Invariants), one panel visible at a time — its own toggle, the same
# pattern as the bench's own tabs (services/reference-control-plane/src/../app.js
# initBench()), a second instance rather than shared code because the two switch
# different panel sets. Plan opens by default (the primary action here), matching how
# the bench itself defaults to its first tab (Shadow).
#
# UI-032's eleven-tab count (checked in webui-markup-structure.test.mjs) is untouched:
# this menu lives inside .bench-agent, a different region from .bench-tabs, so it adds no
# bench tab and breaks nothing D-0236 already declined to touch for that reason.
#
# Every panel's id, every sentence, every form field unchanged — content moved from
# "always shown" to "shown when its menu item is selected", nothing removed.
#
# Built with --network=none --pull=false.
FROM noesar-evolution:phase4-coden-agent-declutter

USER root
COPY --chown=10001:10001 apps/webui-static/ /opt/noesar/apps/webui-static/
USER 10001:10001
